      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This review presented some typically encountered painful sequellae from routine restorative dental treatment. A brief description of the importance of Tomes' processes and free nerve endings were mentioned also. This review should serve as a background for a clinical study concerning posttreatment pain that will be described in a later article."},
